"with Odoo`, which prevents you from connecting the scale to the database. To "
"enable the connection, open the Linux terminal, type `666/dev/` followed by "
"the scale port number, press `ENTER`, then enter the computer password."
msgstr ""
"إذا كنت تُشغّل أودو على جهاز Linux، فسيؤدي النقر فوق زر :guilabel:`توصيل ميزان "
