#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/dpo.rst:5
msgid ""
"`DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ offers in-store payment solutions for "
"customer transactions through several physical `terminals <https://"
"dpogroup.com/products/network-pos/>`_. These terminals support swiping, "
"scanning, or tapping credit and debit cards (Visa, MasterCard, and American "
"Express), as well as Mobile payments (Airtel Money and M-Pesa)."
msgstr ""
"يقدم `DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ حلول الدفع داخل المتجر لمعاملات "
"العملاء من خلال عدة `أجهزة نقاط بيع <https://dpogroup.com/products/network-"
"pos/>`_ فعلية. تدعم هذه الأجهزة السحب أو المسح أو النقر على بطاقات الائتمان "
"والخصم (Visa وMasterCard وAmerican Express)، بالإضافة إلى الدفع عبر الهاتف "
"المحمول (Airtel Money وM-Pesa)."

