#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:3
msgid "QFPay"
msgstr "QFPay"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:5
msgid ""
"QFPay is a payment service that offers payment solutions through the `HaoJin "
"App <https://qfpay.global/products/merchant-app/>`_ for customer "
"transactions with a physical terminal."
msgstr ""
"QFPay هي خدمة دفع تقدم حلول دفع من خلال `تطبيق HaoJin <https://qfpay.global/"
"products/merchant-app/>`_ لمعاملات العملاء باستخدام محطة طرفية فعلية."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:9
msgid ""
"QFPay payment terminals do not require an :doc:`IoT Box </applications/"
"general/iot>` to operate."
msgstr ""
"لا تتطلب محطات الدفع الطرفية QFPay :doc:`صندوق إنترنت الأشياء </applications/"
"general/iot>` للعمل."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:11
msgid "QFPay terminals are exclusively for Hong Kong."
msgstr "محطات QFPay الطرفية مخصصة لهونغ كونغ حصرياً."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:16
msgid "QFPay configuration"
msgstr "إعداد QFPay"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:18
msgid "To configure a QFPay payment terminal, follow these steps:"
msgstr "لإعداد محطة دفع طرفية QFPay، اتبع الخطوات التالية:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:20
msgid ""
"Create a QFPay account on the `QFPay website <https://qfpay.global/products/"
"qfpay-pos-api/>`_."
msgstr ""
"أنشئ حساب QFPay على `موقع QFPay الإلكتروني <https://qfpay.global/products/"
"qfpay-pos-api/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:21
msgid ""
"Request the activation of `Asynchronous Notifications <https://sdk.qfapi.com/"
"docs/common-api/asynchronous-notification/>`_ from QFPay."
msgstr ""
"اطلب تفعيل `الإشعارات غير المتزامنة <https://sdk.qfapi.com/docs/common-api/"
"asynchronous-notification/>`_ من QFPay."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:23
msgid ""
"Provide the Odoo server address to QFPay, followed by `/qfpay/notify`, and "
"copy the notification key provided by QFPay."
msgstr ""
"قدم عنوان خادم Odoo إلى QFPay، متبوعًا بـ `/qfpay/notify`، وانسخ مفتاح "
"الإشعارات المقدم من QFPay."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:25
msgid ""
"Set up the QFPay terminal by connecting the HaoJin App to the QFPay account "
"as instructed by QFPay, then copy the terminal's IP address."
msgstr ""
"قم بإعداد محطة QFPay الطرفية من خلال ربط تطبيق HaoJin بحساب QFPay كما هو "
"موضح من قبل QFPay، ثم انسخ عنوان IP الخاص بالمحطة الطرفية."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:27
msgid ""
"Request a self-signed certificate from QFPay linked to the terminal's IP "
"address, and import it into the POS machine."
msgstr ""
"اطلب شهادة موقعة ذاتيًا من QFPay مرتبطة بعنوان IP الخاص بالمحطة الطرفية، "
"واستوردها إلى جهاز نقطة البيع."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:29
msgid ""
"Generate a :guilabel:`POS-KEY` from the HaoJin App: go "
"to :menuselection:`Haojin App --> My --> Settings --> Pos Call Up Key --> "
"Reset Key`. Then, copy the generated :guilabel:`POS-KEY`."
msgstr ""
"أنشئ :guilabel:`مفتاح POS` من تطبيق HaoJin: انتقل إلى :menuselection:`تطبيق "
"Haojin --> حسابي --> الإعدادات --> مفتاح استدعاء نقطة البيع --> إعادة تعيين "
"المفتاح`. ثم انسخ :guilabel:`مفتاح POS` الذي تم إنشاؤه."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:33
msgid ""
"The **Asynchronous Notifications** are automated messages confirming "
"successful payments or refunds by QFPay."
msgstr ""
"**الإشعارات غير المتزامنة** هي رسائل تلقائية تؤكد نجاح المدفوعات أو المبالغ "
"المستردة من قبل QFPay."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:35
msgid ""
"Write the server address as follows: `https://yourdomain.odoo.com/qfpay/"
"notify`."
msgstr "اكتب عنوان الخادم كما يلي: `https://yourdomain.odoo.com/qfpay/notify`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:36
msgid ""
"If the terminal's IP address changes, update it in the :ref:`Odoo POS "
"settings <pos/use/settings>` and request a new self-signed certificate from "
"QFPay."
msgstr ""
"إذا تغير عنوان IP الخاص بالجهاز، حدّثه في :ref:`إعدادات نقاط البيع في Odoo "
"<pos/use/settings>` واطلب شهادة موقعة ذاتيًا جديدة من QFPay."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:38
msgid ""
"If a QFPay account already exists, contact `technical.support@qfpay.com` "
"with the merchant information and server address."
msgstr ""
"إذا كان حساب QFPay موجوداً بالفعل، اتصل بـ `technical.support@qfpay.com` مع "
"معلومات التاجر وعنوان الخادم."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:42
msgid ""
"Alternatively, retrieve the POS-KEY from the `MMS (Merchant Management "
"System) portal <https://merchant.qfpay.global/>`_: go to :menuselection:`MMS "
"portal --> Settings --> Device Settings`."
msgstr ""
"بدلاً من ذلك، يمكنك استرداد مفتاح POS من `بوابة MMS (نظام إدارة التجار) "
"<https://merchant.qfpay.global/>`_: انتقل إلى :menuselection:`بوابة MMS --> "
"الإعدادات --> إعدادات الجهاز`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/qfpay.rst:51
