#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:86
msgid "Newly configured webhook in the Gelato platform."
msgstr "خطاف الويب المُكوَّن حديثاً في منصة Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:90
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the API key and webhook on a notepad before tabbing out of "
"the Gelato webpage as backup."
